1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
THE BEARDED STRANGER: I said...

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,600
THE BEARDED STRANGER: ...let her go.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,700
THE FORMER GROOM: What are you waiting for?! He's only one man!

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:12,300
THE BEARDED STRANGER: Are you hurt?

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,000
THE BEARDED STRANGER: Good. Then don't touch her again.

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,200
NOBLE MATRIARCH: You cannot interfere in a family matter!

7
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,500
THE BEARDED STRANGER: I can...

8
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,500
THE BEARDED STRANGER: ...when your family is dragging a defenseless woman from a church.

9
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:28,100
THE BEARDED STRANGER: You shouldn't have to beg anybody...

10
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,700
THE BEARDED STRANGER: ...to remember your worth.

11
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,200
LADY JULIANA: Why are you doing this?

12
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,800
THE BEARDED STRANGER: Because I want to.

13
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,800
THE BEARDED STRANGER: You came here to become a wife.

14
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,900
THE BEARDED STRANGER: They took that from you.
